This pattern can be reduced to a `useMemo`
```suggestion
  const slackRedirectUrl = useMemo(() => {
    if (window) {
      return`${window.location.origin}/slack/redirect`;
    }
    return null;
  }, []);
```

HOWEVER, using window.location.orgin can be drilling in from the static props that get passed from the parent component:

[see this stack overflow](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/65199051/how-to-get-page-url-or-hostname-in-nextjs-project)

